---

{/* noindex is EXPLICIT, not inherited: the site-wide default (Base.astro →
    noindex) flips to false at launch, which would make this internal review
    surface indexable at cutover. Being out of the sitemap (astro.config.mjs →
    sitemap filter) doesn't cover it — that withholds a hint, it doesn't keep a
    discovered URL out of an index. Same reasoning as /search/ and the summit
    event pages, and it belongs on LAUNCH.md §3's "confirm each page that opts
    itself out survived the flip" list. This is also the only page that loads
    the third-party Ionicons CDN (`ionicons` below), so staying unindexed keeps
    that origin off every page a search engine can surface. */}
